    <string name="what_is_down_syndrome">What is Down syndrome?</string>
    <string name="down_syndrome_answer">Down syndrome is a genetic condition caused by an extra copy of chromosome 21. It can affect physical growth, learning, and communication, but each child develops in their own way.</string>
    <string name="help_child_communication">How can I help my child improve communication?</string>
    <string name="help_child_communication_answer">Use simple words, daily repetition, visual support, songs, and positive encouragement. Short practice every day gives better results than long irregular sessions.</string>
    <string name="why_early_assessment">Why is early assessment important?</string>
    <string name="why_early_assessment_answer">Early assessment helps identify the current level in motor, language, and speech skills so the app can show suitable activities and challenges.</string>

